# ───────── Design mockups: intermediate HTML ─────────
# `docs/design/src/gen-*.mjs` writes HTML next to itself, then `shoot.mjs` screenshots
# it into `docs/design/v2` and `docs/design/readme`. The PNGs are the reviewed artefact
# and are committed; the HTML is a build step. It only started landing in the repo once
# the generators' output paths were fixed to resolve from their committed location —
# before that they wrote into a phantom `src/Rafeeq-JO/` tree instead.
docs/design/src/*.html
docs/design/src/_mkt-index.json
